chemps2
------------------------------------------
CheMPS2 is a scientific library which contains a spin-adapted implementation of
the density matrix renormalization group (DMRG) for ab initio quantum
chemistry.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libchemps2-devel-1.8.12-1bl2
  libchemps2_3-1.8.12-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libhdf5_320-2.2.0-1
  liblapack0-3.12.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libhdf5-devel-2.2.0-1
  liblapack-devel-3.12.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/SebWouters/CheMPS2

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/SebWouters/CheMPS2/archive/refs/tags/v1.8.12.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack chemps2-1.8.12-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./chemps2-1.8.12-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/chemps2-1.8.12-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/chemps2-1.8.12-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libchemps2_3-1.8.12-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libchemps2-devel-1.8.12-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

